  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 200°C (400°F).",
    "Roll out the pastry dough to a thickness of 3mm.",
    "Place the myeolchi-anchovies in the center of the dough, leaving a 2cm border around them.",
    "Sprinkle the parmesan cheese, thyme, and salt over the anchovies.",
    "Brush the edges of the dough with the beaten eggs.",
    "Fold the dough over the filling to form a square shape.",
    "Cut a small slit in the top of the pastry to allow steam to escape.",
    "Place the en-croute on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Brush the top of the pastry with the melted butter.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes or until golden brown."
